---
/**
 * HennaSideBorders.astro
 * Pass 28: True SVG stroke-drawn henna mandala side borders.
 * Replaces the sliced PNG clip-path curtain reveal with real pen-drawn SVG vector paths.
 * - Left and right ornate henna vines with lotus petals, paisley flourishes, and cabochon dots.
 * - Drawn along their own paths via stroke-dasharray and stroke-dashoffset (HennaDraw style).
 * - Triggered once via IntersectionObserver when entering the viewport.
